  "title": "SoftBank Eyes Massive $25 Billion Stake in OpenAI Amid AI Boom",
  "summary": "In a groundbreaking move, SoftBank is set to invest between $15-25 billion in OpenAI, potentially positioning itself as the largest backer of the AI powerhouse, surpassing Microsoft. This significant financial backing aligns with the launch of Stargate, a $100 billion AI infrastructure project spearheaded by OpenAI, SoftBank, and Oracle. This ambitious venture comes as competition in the AI sector heats up, particularly from Chinese AI firm DeepSeek.",
